            <ArticleTitle>Jejunal obstruction and perforation resulting from herniation through broad ligament.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>189-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Internal herniation of small bowel through broad ligament causing obstruction is rare. A case of jejunal herniation through broad ligament defect with resultant obstruction and perforation is presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
